@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Imperial Military";
}

<div id="header-section">
    <h1 class="imp-header">The Galactic Empire Military</h1>
    <p class="imp-header-text">Defenders of Order &mdash; Enforcers of Peace &mdash; Guardians of the Galaxy</p>
</div>

<div class="about-layout">

    @* Left banner *@
    <div class="about-banner-col">
        <img src="~/images/banner3.jpg" class="about-banner-img" alt="" />
    </div>

    @* Main essay content *@
    <div class="about-content">

        @* ── Section 1 ── *@
        <h2 class="about-heading">The Mightiest Force the Galaxy Has Ever Known</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            For over two decades, the Galactic Empire has maintained the most powerful, disciplined, and feared
            military force the galaxy has ever witnessed. Born from the ashes of the corrupt and ineffectual
            Republic military — a force dependent on genetically engineered conscripts and the erratic wisdom of
            self-appointed Jedi peacekeepers — the Imperial Military represents the pinnacle of organized might,
            superior technology, and unwavering loyalty to Emperor Palpatine and the New Order he has brought
            to a galaxy in desperate need of leadership.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            Where the Galactic Republic once struggled to maintain fragile, temporary peace through the labor of
            clone soldiers bred in laboratories and sold to the highest bidder, the Imperial Military draws its
            strength from a far greater source: the voluntary service of loyal citizens across ten thousand star
            systems. Men and women who understand that true peace is not given — it is earned, defended, and
            enforced. Citizens who recognize that the sacrifice of service is not a burden but an honor, and that
            the protection of civilization itself is the most noble calling one can answer.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Ready to become part of the greatest military force in the history of the galaxy?
                Your place in history is waiting — and it begins with a single application.
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Begin Your Application</a>
        </div>

        @* ── Section 2 ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">Order Through Strength</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            The fundamental doctrine of the Imperial Military is as clear as it is effective: stability through
            superior force. In a galaxy once consumed by the chaos of the Clone Wars — a conflict that left entire
            systems in ruin, economies shattered, and civilian populations caught between warring factions — the
            Empire stands as the one institution capable of delivering true and lasting peace. Our legions have
            pacified worlds that had known bloodshed for generations. Our Star Destroyers have brought law and
            commerce to systems where lawlessness once reigned unchecked.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            Critics of the Empire — and there will always be those who prefer comfortable lies over uncomfortable
            peace — speak of heavy-handedness and control. What they label as control, the merchants along the
            Outer Rim hyperspace lanes call the freedom to conduct commerce without fear of piracy. What they
            call enforcement, communities once terrorized by criminal syndicates such as the Pyke Syndicate and
            Black Sun call rescue. The Imperial Military does not ask for gratitude. It asks only for the
            opportunity to serve the people it protects.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Ready to stand as a defender of order and a shield against the chaos that threatens every
                citizen of the galaxy? The Empire needs those who believe in something greater than themselves.
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Serve the Empire</a>
        </div>

        @* Image Placeholder 1 – full width *@
        <div class="about-img-placeholder">
            <div class="about-placeholder-inner">
                <span class="about-placeholder-tag">Image Pending &mdash; Classification Review</span>
                <span class="about-placeholder-title">Imperial Victory — Suppression of Rebel Insurgency on Onderon</span>
                <span class="about-placeholder-caption">Image Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* ── Section 3 ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">The Imperial Army</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            The backbone of Imperial ground operations, the Imperial Army is a force without equal in the history
            of land warfare. Comprised of hundreds of thousands of infantry divisions, heavy armor battalions,
            artillery regiments, and rapid-response mechanized units, the Army has demonstrated its effectiveness
            on battlefields stretching from the mineral-rich mountains of Lothal to the treacherous jungle floors
            of Felucia. No terrain is too hostile, no climate too extreme, no enemy too entrenched.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            Imperial Army soldiers undergo rigorous training at fortified facilities across the Core Worlds and
            Mid Rim, forging civilians into disciplined warriors capable of operating in any environment and any
            combat scenario. Equipped with the finest weapons and battlefield hardware produced by the Empire's
            vast industrial complex — from the blaster rifles of BlasTech to the AT-AT walkers of Kuat Drive
            Yards — Army personnel represent the Emperor's will made manifest on the ground. When an Imperial
            Army division arrives, the conflict ends. The question is never whether the Empire will prevail; it
            is only how quickly the opposition will recognize the inevitability of their situation.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Do you have what it takes to march under the Imperial banner across any battlefield, any world,
                in any conditions? Boots on the ground win wars. The Imperial Army is where that starts.
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Join the Imperial Army</a>
        </div>

        @* ── Section 4 ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">The Imperial Navy</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            Above the clouds and beyond the atmosphere, the Imperial Navy commands the stars. Anchored by the
            legendary Imperial-class Star Destroyers — over one mile of pure military might, carrying more than
            nine thousand troops, dozens of turbolaser batteries, and an entire starfighter complement — the Navy
            is the Empire's most visible and most feared instrument of power. Wherever an Imperial Star Destroyer
            maintains orbital position, order follows without question.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            The Navy encompasses everything from nimble TIE squadrons that provide rapid atmospheric and space
            superiority support, to the colossal Super Star Destroyers that serve as mobile command platforms for
            the Empire's senior admiralty. Tens of millions of officers, technical specialists, weapons crews,
            and support personnel maintain the fleet across thousands of active deployment zones spanning the
            galaxy from the Core to the Unknown Regions. The Navy's true achievement lies not merely in the
            construction of so vast a fleet — though that alone is an engineering triumph unprecedented in
            galactic history — but in the establishment of total hyperspace dominance. No vessel travels between
            systems without the knowledge that the long arm of the Imperial Navy can reach them anywhere, at any
            time.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Want to pilot a TIE Fighter and rule the skies, command the bridge of a Star Destroyer,
                or keep the galaxy's greatest warships operational? The Imperial Navy has a post for you.
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Join the Imperial Navy</a>
        </div>

        @* Image Placeholder 2 – two side by side *@
        <div class="about-img-row">
            <div class="about-img-placeholder half">
                <div class="about-placeholder-inner">
                    <span class="about-placeholder-tag">Image Pending</span>
                    <span class="about-placeholder-title">Star Destroyers in Formation Above Scarif — Naval Power Projection</span>
                    <span class="about-placeholder-caption">Image Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-img-placeholder half">
                <div class="about-placeholder-inner">
                    <span class="about-placeholder-tag">Image Pending</span>
                    <span class="about-placeholder-title">Imperial Armor Division — Ground Superiority Achieved on Mimban</span>
                    <span class="about-placeholder-caption">Image Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* ── Section 5 ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">The Stormtrooper Corps</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            Perhaps no symbol in the galaxy is more immediately recognized — or more appropriately respected —
            than the white armor of the Imperial Stormtrooper. The Corps represents the Emperor's elite shock
            infantry: highly trained, fanatically dedicated, and utterly committed to the preservation of
            Imperial order at any cost and in any environment. They are the shield of civilization and the sword
            of the Emperor's justice.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            The Stormtrooper Corps encompasses dozens of highly specialized units adapted for every conceivable
            combat environment. Snowtroopers designed for arctic operations in temperatures that would incapacitate
            unprotected soldiers within minutes. Sandtroopers hardened for desert warfare in the unforgiving wastelands
            of the Outer Rim. Scout Troopers who serve as the forward eyes and ears of field commanders in contested
            territory. Shore Troopers who secure the Empire's most critical coastal and island installations.
            Death Troopers who operate in the classified shadows of Imperial Intelligence operations. Jumptroopers
            who bring vertical superiority to any engagement. Each specialization represents a different facet of
            the Corps' core philosophy: any environment can be conquered by a soldier who has been trained,
            equipped, and mentally prepared to face it.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Think you have the discipline and grit to wear the armor of the Empire's most elite soldiers?
                The Stormtrooper Corps doesn't find just anyone worthy — prove you are.
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Apply to the Corps</a>
        </div>

        @* ── Section 6 ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">Imperial Intelligence &amp; The Security Bureau</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            Behind every military victory lies an architecture of knowledge. Imperial Intelligence and the Imperial
            Security Bureau represent two sides of the same essential function — ensuring that the Empire always
            knows more than its enemies, acts before its adversaries can act, and identifies treachery before it
            can take root. The shadow services of the Empire are its most silent defenders, and among its most
            effective.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            No rebel cell has survived long in a system where ISB agents are actively embedded. No smuggling
            operation has endured under the sustained scrutiny of Imperial Intelligence analysts. These are not
            agencies of oppression, as the Rebel Alliance's propaganda would have citizens believe. They are
            agencies of protection — the unseen hands that keep the galaxy's billions safe from the chaos that
            terrorists and criminals would eagerly invite back into every community, every market, every home.
        </p>

        <div class="about-section-cta">
            <p class="about-section-cta-text">
                Have the intelligence, the discretion, and the nerve to operate where others cannot?
                The ISB and Imperial Intelligence recruit only the most capable. Do you have what it takes
                to serve in the shadows?
            </p>
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button btn-section-enlist">Apply to Imperial Intelligence</a>
        </div>

        @* Image Placeholder 3 – full width *@
        <div class="about-img-placeholder">
            <div class="about-placeholder-inner">
                <span class="about-placeholder-tag">Image Pending &mdash; Classification Review</span>
                <span class="about-placeholder-title">Stormtrooper Corps in Full Formation — The Emperor's Elite on Parade</span>
                <span class="about-placeholder-caption">Image Coming Soon</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* ── Closing section ── *@
        <div class="about-divider"></div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">Join the Empire. Defend the Galaxy.</h2>

        <p class="about-text">
            The Imperial Military is not merely an institution. It is a calling. It is the acknowledgment that
            civilization does not sustain itself — that order must be actively maintained, that peace must be
            constantly defended, and that there will always be those who would tear down what billions of beings
            have built across millennia. The Empire is the answer to that threat. The Imperial Military is the
            instrument by which that answer is delivered.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            Whether your skills lie in command, in combat, in the cockpit of a starfighter, in the engine room
            of a Star Destroyer, in the intelligence archives of the Security Bureau, or in the field medicine
            stations behind the front lines — the Imperial Military has a place for you. Your service matters.
            Your loyalty matters. The Empire needs men and women of character, of conviction, and of courage.
            It needs citizens willing to rise above the ordinary and commit themselves to something greater than
            any single life can contain.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
            The galaxy depends on those willing to defend it. The Emperor calls. Will you answer?
        </p>

        <div class="about-cta">
            <a href="/Military/Applications" class="button about-enlist-btn">
                Apply to Serve the Empire &rarr;
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>

    @* Right banner *@
    <div class="about-banner-col">
        <img src="~/images/banner3.jpg" class="about-banner-img" alt="" />
    </div>

</div>
